{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;PomoTrain: Rabbit Town&gt;\u00a0</strong>is an idle game with built-in Pomodoro features where you become the conductor of a cute rabbit village, growing and customizing both the town and the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of ambient sounds and background music are provided, and you can also upload your own favorite tracks or listen through YouTube integration within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, step into the role of the rabbit village\u2019s conductor and set off on a journey together with your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/24dad6ab91d89d80f300be6d6a89a5c5.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/24dad6ab91d89d80f300be6d6a89a5c5.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/24dad6ab91d89d80f300be6d6a89a5c5.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train Journey with Adorable Rabbit Residents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the train, collect hearts, and meet various rabbit residents. Adorable rabbits are ready to welcome you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/0d2b0d4481fcd7c5c5cb75a7c4e92ef7.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/0d2b0d4481fcd7c5c5cb75a7c4e92ef7.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/0d2b0d4481fcd7c5c5cb75a7c4e92ef7.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Google Calendar Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your schedule effortlessly by syncing with Google Calendar. Your in-game calendar and Google Calendar work seamlessly together, allowing you to view your entire schedule at a glance. You can also use the To-Do list to record and efficiently manage your daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c6e3f02de230a2c459339e01e2ff0cd0.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c6e3f02de230a2c459339e01e2ff0cd0.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c6e3f02de230a2c459339e01e2ff0cd0.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train That Grows with You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your focus and effort build up, the gold earned through Pomodoro sessions drives the train forward and brings the village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c54ff4b56159babfc5c0e59182355747.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c54ff4b56159babfc5c0e59182355747.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c54ff4b56159babfc5c0e59182355747.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Music Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect soundtrack for your work sessions. Enhance your immersion with in-game BGM, or upload your own music and link YouTube to enjoy your personal playlists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/907a155a719b2eb1c311ced42c59a159.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/907a155a719b2eb1c311ced42c59a159.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/907a155a719b2eb1c311ced42c59a159.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Whistle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/d299dbba12536cb2176eb27c4944bee08abe056a.jpg"},{"name":"Warming Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/a5cbee24d955dd0596a64c640e2107966b8a81dd.jpg"},{"name":"Departure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/1a6a87bfa719068f88dca672dfb2b0e097889184.jpg"},{"name":"Diligent Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/a0e374847d09e350e1b7c5ecf3400c854bb537f5.jpg"},{"name":"Joy of Immersion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/b578f5516e08f8f2a9d71241b0ff8984120d0c11.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Will","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/672daf6a0cec48249dbd2d6473b4f52b778aba2a.jpg"},{"name":"Master Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/bc280b21d53ebbd5d35e722ed043376b53134fbe.jpg"},{"name":"Three-Day Determination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/8121f2f4ada1b542521bc4ac42f1b49958916dab.jpg"},{"name":"Miracle of a Week","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/a537a07e5ae8afb400c34b842a02358e4a871772.jpg"},{"name":"Habit Formation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/6fb512dec09465da75d2e4395898fb555da4fd62.jpg"}],"total":73},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969190?t=1774501650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/c1ab7a6e351187b072f3d78657fba45253f30c81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774501650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/0fc7a09450764d0a7514e8c083f8bdb5fe634f76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774501650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/0fc7a09450764d0a7514e8c083f8bdb5fe634f76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774501650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;PomoTrain: Rabbit Town&gt;\u00a0</strong>is an idle game with built-in Pomodoro features where you become the conductor of a cute rabbit village, growing and customizing both the town and the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of ambient sounds and background music are provided, and you can also upload your own favorite tracks or listen through YouTube integration within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, step into the role of the rabbit village\u2019s conductor and set off on a journey together with your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/24dad6ab91d89d80f300be6d6a89a5c5.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/24dad6ab91d89d80f300be6d6a89a5c5.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/24dad6ab91d89d80f300be6d6a89a5c5.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train Journey with Adorable Rabbit Residents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the train, collect hearts, and meet various rabbit residents. Adorable rabbits are ready to welcome you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/0d2b0d4481fcd7c5c5cb75a7c4e92ef7.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/0d2b0d4481fcd7c5c5cb75a7c4e92ef7.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/0d2b0d4481fcd7c5c5cb75a7c4e92ef7.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Google Calendar Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your schedule effortlessly by syncing with Google Calendar. Your in-game calendar and Google Calendar work seamlessly together, allowing you to view your entire schedule at a glance. You can also use the To-Do list to record and efficiently manage your daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c6e3f02de230a2c459339e01e2ff0cd0.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c6e3f02de230a2c459339e01e2ff0cd0.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c6e3f02de230a2c459339e01e2ff0cd0.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train That Grows with You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your focus and effort build up, the gold earned through Pomodoro sessions drives the train forward and brings the village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c54ff4b56159babfc5c0e59182355747.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c54ff4b56159babfc5c0e59182355747.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/c54ff4b56159babfc5c0e59182355747.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Music Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect soundtrack for your work sessions. Enhance your immersion with in-game BGM, or upload your own music and link YouTube to enjoy your personal playlists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/907a155a719b2eb1c311ced42c59a159.poster.avif?t=1774501650\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/907a155a719b2eb1c311ced42c59a159.webm?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/907a155a719b2eb1c311ced42c59a159.mp4?t=1774501650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["kupstudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/92a2895b4bb5f32110920a2797f91897e67f2ca3/header.jpg?t=1774501650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i-3 4th Generation or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Integrated HD 6100+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest OSX Version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3GHz dual-core Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics 640<br></li><li><strong>S